## Implementation review findings

All of this work is merged into `release/v3.1.0`: #155 (findings, provenance, diagram text alternatives), #156 (faster agent views), #157 (G0 gap fixes, include handling, named child blocks, docs), #158 (dangers of other sections), #160 (G1 budgets) and #162 (model runner). No branch holds review work any more. So every row is **source and tests, not released**, and none has study evidence.

